[{"id":5403976460,"node_id":"LE_lADOCX5JB848gnQZzwAAAAFCGiMM","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sqlalchemy/sqlalchemy/issues/events/5403976460","actor":{"login":"avilaton","id":2209022,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMDkwMjI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2209022?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/avilaton","html_url":"https://github.com/avilaton","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/avilaton/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/avilaton/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/avilaton/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/avilaton/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/avilaton/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/avilaton/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/avilaton/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/avilaton/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/avilaton/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"event":"labeled","commit_id":null,"commit_url":null,"created_at":"2021-10-04T13:26:14Z","label":{"name":"requires triage","color":"ffff00"},"performed_via_github_app":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sqlalchemy/sqlalchemy/issues/comments/933507524","html_url":"https://github.com/sqlalchemy/sqlalchemy/issues/7140#issuecomment-933507524","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sqlalchemy/sqlalchemy/issues/7140","id":933507524,"node_id":"IC_kwDOCX5JB843pDHE","user":{"login":"zzzeek","id":128223,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyODIyMw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/128223?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzzeek","html_url":"https://github.com/zzzeek","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzzeek/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzzeek/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzzeek/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzzeek/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzzeek/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzzeek/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzzeek/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzzeek/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzzeek/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2021-10-04T13:51:25Z","updated_at":"2021-10-04T13:51:25Z","body":"hi -\r\n\r\nthis operator is not just for PostgreSQL, it also applies to MySQL and possibly other backends, so generically i think it's important that it not have any surprises.   The above issue you report does not seem to be a surprise to me, it looks like the SQL code is rendering exactly as the Python code you've given it, and the function is behaving consistently here in a standalone vs. method context:\r\n\r\n```py\r\n>>> print(column('q').any_() == None)\r\nANY (q) IS NULL\r\n>>> print(column('q').any_().is_(None))\r\nANY (q) IS NULL\r\n```\r\nthis is no different from any other parenthesized SQL element.\r\n\r\nIf I wanted to render \"NULL == ANY(expr)\", I would do just that, pull NULL on the left side:\r\n\r\n```py\r\n>>> from sqlalchemy import column, any_, null\r\n>>> print(null() == column('q').any_())\r\nNULL = ANY (q)\r\n>>> print(null() == (any_(column('q'))))\r\nNULL = ANY (q)\r\n```\r\n\r\nSQLAlchemy is going to try to be as WYSIWYG, so IS renders IS:\r\n\r\n```py\r\n>>> print(null().is_(column('q').any_()))\r\nNULL IS ANY (q)\r\n>>> print(null().is_(any_(column('q'))))\r\nNULL IS ANY (q)\r\n```\r\n\r\netc.\r\n\r\nI do see some documentation issues to be fixed however, such as a lack of cross-linking between column.any_() and standalone any_(), as well as misleading docs on posgresl.ARRAY.any_() suggesting the method is \"legacy\" which it's not.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sqlalchemy/sqlalchemy/issues/comments/933507524/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"zzzeek","id":128223,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyODIyMw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/128223?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzzeek","html_url":"https://github.com/zzzeek","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzzeek/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzzeek/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzzeek/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzzeek/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzzeek/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzzeek/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzzeek/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzzeek/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzzeek/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"id":5404162383,"node_id":"RTE_lADOCX5JB848gnQZzwAAAAFCHPlP","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sqlalchemy/sqlalchemy/issues/events/5404162383","actor":{"login":"zzzeek","id":128223,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyODIyMw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/128223?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzzeek","html_url":"https://github.com/zzzeek","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzzeek/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzzeek/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzzeek/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzzeek/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzzeek/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzzeek/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzzeek/repos","eve